    "updated_at": "2015-10-22T21:33:19Z",
    "body": "I'm a new contributor but I think this would be a great change. In addition to replacing all instances of whitelist/blacklist with safelist/blocklist as described in the commit message, for consistency I've changed a few instances of \"white-list(ed/ing)\" to the more commonly used \"whitelist(ed/ing)\" before replacing with \"safelist\". If there are any other changes necessary to adequately address this issue, please let me know and I'll be happy to make those changes.\n",
