    "body": "The changes look good to me, but I wonder if the online whitelist/safelist concept couldn't be given a more appropriate name. It's not really a list of allowed or safe things, it's a list of things where appcache should be bypassed. Maybe the \"cache bypass namespaces\" and \"cache bypass wildcard flag\"? @annevk?\n",
